  "comments": [
    {
      "position": 0,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "＊This grammar has the connotation of resolving not to do something.\n\nFORMATION:\nＶ(dict. form) + まい\nＶ(minus ます) + まい\nALSO USED:\nする -> しまい\nくる -> こまい",
      "html": "＊This grammar has the connotation of resolving not to do something.<br/><br/>FORMATION:<br/>Ｖ(dict. form) + まい<br/>Ｖ(minus ます) + まい<br/>ALSO USED:<br/>する -&gt; しまい<br/>くる -&gt; こまい",
      "credits_raw": "rubyhatchet",
      "content_sha256": "081d7af3dbb35d2cae2c27c74c728e6763f873475254f15cbddbbf678c5d3e3c",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 1,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Not used in typical spoken Japanese.",
      "html": "Not used in typical spoken Japanese.",
      "credits_raw": "Amatuka",
      "content_sha256": "adc6d0b8170c0037024bd853ba16d54f775ef6a88e681b46b0771ecfd6e6abda",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "N.B. Derivation of ~まい involves uncertainty - extension to 'negative violition' arrived the same way as the +ve violition did. \nTherefore, literally, it's more like \"I probably won't tell ...\" \"I don't think I'll tell ...\"",
      "html": "N.B. Derivation of ~まい involves uncertainty - extension to 'negative violition' arrived the same way as the +ve violition did. <br/>Therefore, literally, it's more like \"I probably won't tell ...\" \"I don't think I'll tell ...\"",
      "credits_raw": "Amatuka",
      "content_sha256": "615ec9b6f22928673d2f3899cc3ee0aaaaea73f3b14f510e8b0ac0f041522820",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 3,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "What about a past tense? How would one say: \"He wouldn't tell me.\" ?",
      "html": "What about a past tense? How would one say: \"He wouldn't tell me.\" ?",
      "credits_raw": "Jon",
      "content_sha256": "3f2a217d36e2c1b06dadf6964820204001f425497815400560788d0e5b3ed813",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 4,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "彼は言わなかっただろう。\nI don't think there is a past tense of まい version.\n言わないだろう。/ 言わないようにしよう。is more popular spoken style of 言うまい。",
      "html": "彼は言わなかっただろう。<br/>I don't think there is a past tense of まい version.<br/>言わないだろう。/ 言わないようにしよう。is more popular spoken style of 言うまい。",
      "credits_raw": "Miki",
      "content_sha256": "23db5f5f8057228f5a3bc272b790e691934441b336d0dc7946ff5e84ecd7dd42",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
